# Karaage-Style Chicken & Sweet Potato Fries 🍗🍠
***
## Ingredients (for 2 people):

| Chicken Marinade                     | Sweet Potato Fries                  | Karaage-Style Chicken (Frying) |
|:-----------------------------------:|:-----------------------------------:|:------------------------------:|
| 2 chicken fillets                   | 2 medium-sized sweet potatoes       | 50 g flour                     |
| 2 tablespoons sesame oil            | 1 plastic bag                       | 100 g breadcrumbs              |          
| 2 tablespoons sweet soy sauce       | 5 tablespoons frying oil            | 1 egg                          |
| 1 egg                               | Curry, salt, pepper, and garlic powder | Frying oil                 |
| Chili, ginger, and garlic powder    |
| Salt, pepper                        |

